s, desde petiscos até comidas mais elaboradas. Além disso, possui timer sonoro de 60 minutos e o desligamento automático ao fim do preparo ou quando a gaveta for aberta. \n\nFaça suas receitas favoritas sem a necessidade de óleo: pães caseiros, hambúrgueres, cupcakes, coxinhas de frango, pudins e muito mais com a sua Fritadeira AirFry Mega de 9 litros. \n\nWAP | DEIXA TUDO MAIS FÁCIL!", "meli_short_description_type": "plaintext", "meli_type": "catalog_product", "meli_n_attributes": "20", "meli_n_children_ids": "0", "meli_n_description_pictures": "0", "meli_n_disclaimers": "0", "meli_n_enhanced_content_components": "1", "meli_n_main_features": "8", "meli_n_pdp_types": "1", "meli_n_pickers": "2", "meli_n_pictures": "12", "meli_n_tags": "0", "meli_first_picture_url": "https://http2.mlstatic.com/D_NQ_NP_881028-MLA114466295878_082026-F.jpg", "meli_sibling_product_ids": "[\"MLB63241465\",\"MLB63241469\"]", "meli_ingested_at": "2026-09-15 17:34:46", "meli_attributes": "{\"BRAND\":\"Wap\",\"COLOR\":\"Preto\",\"FUNCTIONS\":\"Assar\",\"HEIGHT\":\"30.2 cm\",\"INCLUDES_ACCESSORIES\":\"Sim\",\"LINE\":\"Prosdócimo\",\"MIN_TEMPERATURE\":\"80 °C\",\"MODEL\":\"MEGA FAMILY 9L\",\"VOLTAGE\":\"127V\",\"VOLUME_CAPACITY\":\"9 L\",\"WITH_NON_STICK_SURFACE\":\"Sim\",\"ACCESSORIES_INCLUDED\":\"Cesto\",\"ALPHANUMERIC_MODEL\":\"FW010521/FW010522\",\"CONTROL_TYPES\":\"Botões\",\"LENGTH\":\"46.1 cm\",\"MAIN_COLOR\":\"Preto\",\"MAX_TEMPERATURE\":\"200 °C\",\"WEIGHT\":\"5.94 kg\",\"WIDTH\":\"37.9 cm\",\"WITH_SEE_THROUGH_WINDOW\":\"Não\"}"}}}